#ASSERT `s 1129 the Companies Acts require the person to disclose the information` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1129 the Companies Acts require the person to disclose the information` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 1129 the Companies Acts require the person to disclose the information` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

