#ASSERT `s 1130(1) the proceedings meet the requirement of s 1130(1)` TRUE `s 1130(1) the name of a member of the body` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1130(1) the proceedings meet the requirement of s 1130(1)` FALSE `s 1130(1) the name of the body` EQUALS NOTHING
